      <title>20万美元飞行器卖两年后 Pivotal CEO 离职 个人航空商业化遇阻</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/geek001/post/20260902/20%E4%B8%87%E7%BE%8E%E5%85%83%E9%A3%9E%E8%A1%8C%E5%99%A8%E5%8D%96%E4%B8%A4%E5%B9%B4%E5%90%8E-Pivotal-CEO-%E7%A6%BB%E8%81%8C-%E4%B8%AA%E4%BA%BA%E8%88%AA%E7%A9%BA%E5%95%86%E4%B8%9A%E5%8C%96%E9%81%87%E9%98%BB/</link>
